########## Q3-判别档：.mcp.json 里用「真实存在」的环境变量 ##########
cwd(bash) = /e/aicoding/mini-claude-code
cwd(win)  = E:\aicoding\mini-claude-code
MCP_TEST_PYTHON = D:\Anaconda3\envs\aicoding\python.exe
MCP_TEST_SERVER = E:\aicoding\mini-claude-code\servers\local_tools_server.py
这两个变量在本 shell 中确实已设置：2 个
--- .mcp.json 内容 ---
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "envtest": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "${MCP_TEST_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["${MCP_TEST_SERVER}"]
    }
  }
}
--- claude -p ---
FOUND

